---
import { BookOpen, ExternalLink, Award } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<section id="publications" class="py-20 bg-slate-50">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mb-12">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-sky-100">
        Research & Scholarship
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-3 tracking-tight">
        Publications
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-base mt-2">
        Peer-reviewed research presented at premier international conferences.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Paper Card -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow max-w-4xl">
      <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 flex-wrap">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-200">
            <Award class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
            CHI 2015 Conference
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 bg-slate-100 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">
            ~20% Acceptance Rate
          </span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500">Seoul, South Korea</span>
      </div>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-4 leading-snug">
        An Interactive System for Data Structure Development
      </h3>

      <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 font-medium mt-2">
        <strong class="text-sky-700">Jibin Ou</strong>, Martin Vechev, Otmar Hilliges
      </p>

      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">
        In Proceedings of the 33rd Annual ACM Conference on Human Factors in Computing Systems (CHI 2015).
      </p>

      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-4 leading-relaxed">
        Research developed during visiting scholarship at ETH Zürich (HCI & Software Reliability Labs), presenting a novel interactive visualization and synthesis interface for understanding, debugging, and manipulating complex memory and data structures.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
